Huntsman's house is severe and serious, the same as its owner. On the door there is a large copper ring, fixed in grinning iron jaws of an animal. Those who are not acquainted with Beobras may be disinclined to come in, only by the sight of the house. Actually, appearances are deceptive. Beobras is a good-natured person; he is frightening only to enemies of Mech-City. You come up to the door and seize the ring.